<concept_spec>

concept Aggregator

purpose
    maintain a rolling window of metrics and compute ratios/trends

state
    a set of Snapshots with
        a snapshotId String
        a ts Number
        a studentCount Number
        a phoneUsers Number

actions
    accumulate (frameId: String, studentCount: Number, phoneUsers: Number) : (snapshotId: String)
        add a snapshot for the frame
        return snapshotId

queries
    _windowStats (seconds: Number) : (avgStudentCount: Number, avgPhoneUsers: Number, phoneUseRatio: Number, rising: Boolean)
        compute averages and simple rising trend over the last window

</concept_spec>

